@startuml state-storage-location
title State Diagram(Storage Location Lifecycle)

' Source: PR #90 revision of backend-state-machines.md.

state "available" as Available
state "reserved" as Reserved
state "occupied" as Occupied
state "disabled" as Disabled

[*] --> Available : create location
Available --> Reserved : reserve for parcel
Reserved --> Occupied : shelve parcel
Reserved --> Available : cancel reservation
Occupied --> Available : remove parcel
Available --> Disabled : disable location
Disabled --> Available : enable location

note right of Occupied
  One storage location can hold at most one parcel.
end note

note right of Disabled
  Disabled locations are excluded from recommendations.
end note

@enduml
